---
/*
 * PRIVACY & COOKIES POLICY (English).
 *
 * ⚠️ BEFORE GOING LIVE — this is a solid starting draft, faithful to what the
 * page actually does (WhatsApp handoff, email via Web3Forms, Google Ads tag —
 * no consent banner is implemented; the tag fires unconditionally on every
 * page view). This is NOT legal advice. Still needed:
 *   1. Fill in the [PLACEHOLDER] fields below — legal name, address, VAT/tax ID, DPO/email.
 *   2. Have this text reviewed by someone qualified in the applicable law (e.g. GDPR) —
 *      in particular, decide whether EU/EEA traffic requires an actual consent banner
 *      before the Google tag loads, and implement one if so.
 * The three third parties named (Google, Web3Forms, Meta/WhatsApp) are the
 * only data recipients used by this page — keep this current if that changes.
 */
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import { CONTACT, OFFER } from '../config'

const updated = 'August 2026'
---

<Layout
    title={`Privacy Policy | ${OFFER.company}`}
    description="Privacy and cookies policy: how we handle data collected through this site."
    lang="en"
    ogLocale="en_US"
    tripName={`${OFFER.tripLengthDays}-day Tanzania honeymoon safari`}>
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 lg:py-20">
        <a href="/" class="text-sm font-medium text-primary hover:underline">&larr; Back to main page</a>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold md:text-4xl">Privacy & Cookies Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: {updated}</p>

        <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
            <section>
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">1. Data Controller</h2>
                <p>
                    The controller responsible for data collected through this site is
                    <strong>[LEGAL NAME — e.g. African Polecat Safaris]</strong>,
                    registered at <strong>[FULL ADDRESS]</strong>
                    (<strong>[registration / VAT number]</strong>).
                    For any request relating to your data, you can write to us at
                    <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`} class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2">{CONTACT.email}</a>.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">2. What Data We Collect</h2>
                <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
                    <li><strong>Inquiry form data:</strong> full name, email address, travel month, number of travellers and any note you voluntarily provide.</li>
                    <li><strong>Communication data:</strong> if you contact us via WhatsApp or email, the content of those messages and associated contact details.</li>
                    <li><strong>Browsing and cookie data:</strong> identifiers and data collected by Google's advertising tags for campaign measurement (see §5).</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">3. Purposes and Legal Bases</h2>
                <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
                    <li><strong>Responding to inquiries and preparing quotes</strong> — legal basis: steps taken at your request prior to entering a contract (GDPR art. 6.1.b).</li>
                    <li><strong>Advertising measurement and optimization</strong> via Google cookies — legal basis: legitimate interest in measuring and improving our advertising campaigns (GDPR art. 6.1.f). [To be confirmed by qualified legal counsel — a consent-based basis may be required instead, depending on your traffic and applicable law.]</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">4. How We Handle Form Submissions</h2>
                <p>
                    When you submit the form, the data is sent to our inbox via
                    <strong>Web3Forms</strong> (Reslancer LLP) and, if you choose to continue, opens a
                    conversation on <strong>WhatsApp</strong>. We do not store the data in a database on
                    this site: we receive it by email so we can reply to you.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">5. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
                <p>
                    We use the <strong>Google tag (Google Ads)</strong> to measure conversions from our
                    advertising campaigns. This tag loads automatically when you visit the site;
                    <strong>we do not currently use a cookie consent banner</strong>. You can control
                    or delete these cookies at any time through your browser's settings.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">6. Data Recipients</h2>
                <p>We only share data with the providers necessary to deliver the service:</p>
                <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
                    <li><strong>Google Ireland Ltd.</strong> — advertising tag and conversion measurement.</li>
                    <li><strong>Web3Forms (Reslancer LLP)</strong> — email delivery of form submissions.</li>
                    <li><strong>Meta Platforms Ireland Ltd. (WhatsApp)</strong> — if you contact us via WhatsApp.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">7. Transfers Outside the EU/EEA</h2>
                <p>
                    Some providers may process data outside the European Economic Area. In that case,
                    the transfer relies on the safeguards provided under GDPR (e.g. the European
                    Commission's standard contractual clauses).
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">8. Retention Period</h2>
                <p>
                    We retain inquiry data for as long as needed to process it and any resulting
                    correspondence, and in any case no longer than applicable regulations require. Data
                    collected via cookies is retained according to the periods set by the respective
                    providers.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">9. Your Rights</h2>
                <p>
                    You have the right to access, rectify, or delete your data, to restrict or object to
                    its processing, to data portability, and to withdraw your consent at any time
                    (GDPR art. 15–22). To exercise these rights, write to
                    <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`} class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2">{CONTACT.email}</a>.
                    You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the competent data protection
                    supervisory authority.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">10. Contact</h2>
                <p>
                    {OFFER.company} · WhatsApp {CONTACT.whatsappDisplay} ·
                    <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`} class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2">{CONTACT.email}</a>
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>
